#: lib/modules/storage/web/dimension_form.html.heex:274
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An iPhone or Pixel photo carries an HDR gain map, which lets bright areas glow on an HDR screen. A size with this on is made with the map kept; without it the size is an ordinary picture. It applies to JPEG sizes, whether they keep the photo's proportions or crop it to a box, and only to photos that have a map. It adds a few KB per picture, and applies to sizes made from now on."
msgstr "iPhone 或 Pixel 照片带有 HDR 增益图，可使明亮区域在 HDR 屏幕上发光。开启此项的尺寸会保留增益图；否则该尺寸是普通图片。它适用于 JPEG 尺寸，无论保持照片比例还是裁剪为框，且只适用于带有增益图的照片。每张图片会增加几 KB，并适用于此后生成的尺寸。"

