msgstr "运行该工具但不更改任何内容，并返回预览。"

#: lib/phoenix_kit_web/live/settings/api_guide_panel.html.heex:294
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A dangerous operation first returns a preview and a one-time code. Repeat the same call with confirm_token set to that code within %{count} second."
msgid_plural "A dangerous operation first returns a preview and a one-time code. Repeat the same call with confirm_token set to that code within %{count} seconds."
msgstr[0] "危险操作会先返回预览和一次性代码。请在 %{count} 秒内，使用将 confirm_token 设置为该代码的相同调用再次发起。"

#: lib/phoenix_kit_web/live/settings/api_guide_panel.html.heex:299
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Any write that touches more than %{count} row is dangerous too."
msgid_plural "Any write that touches more than %{count} rows is dangerous too."
msgstr[0] "任何涉及超过 %{count} 行的写入也属于危险操作。"

#: lib/phoenix_kit_web/live/settings/api_guide_panel.html.heex:307
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "16 to 128 characters: letters, digits, - and _. The same key with the same arguments returns the first answer instead of running twice; answers are kept for %{count} hour."
msgid_plural "16 to 128 characters: letters, digits, - and _. The same key with the same arguments returns the first answer instead of running twice; answers are kept for %{count} hours."
msgstr[0] "16 到 128 个字符：字母、数字、- 和 _。使用相同参数的相同密钥会返回第一次的结果，而不会运行两次；结果会保留 %{count} 小时。"

#: lib/phoenix_kit_web/live/settings/api_guide_panel.html.heex:316
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A key that requires approval does not run any write, dangerous or not: the call returns pending_approval and waits up to %{count} hour for a person to approve it."
msgid_plural "A key that requires approval does not run any write, dangerous or not: the call returns pending_approval and waits up to %{count} hours for a person to approve it."
msgstr[0] "需要审批的密钥不会执行任何写入，无论是否危险：调用会返回 pending_approval，并最多等待 %{count} 小时，直到有人批准。"

